{"ticker":"TJX","updated":"2026-11-07T01:58:21Z","profile":{"longName":"The TJX Companies, Inc.","shortName":"TJX Companies, Inc. (The)","sector":"Consumer Cyclical","industry":"Apparel Retail","country":"United States","website":"https://www.tjx.com","fullTimeEmployees":377000,"marketCap":148826488832,"trailingPE":25.055555,"forwardPE":23.48457,"priceToSalesTrailing12Months":2.3864548,"pegRatio":2.46,"targetMeanPrice":171.15788,"targetHighPrice":198.0,"targetLowPrice":136.0,"numberOfAnalystOpinions":19,"recommendationKey":"buy","revenueGrowth":0.054,"earningsGrowth":0.236,"grossMargins":0.31467,"operatingMargins":0.10909,"profitMargins":0.09729,"totalRevenue":62363000832,"beta":0.587,"fiftyTwoWeekHigh":170.0,"fiftyTwoWeekLow":122.78,"currency":"USD","exchange":"NYQ","quoteType":"EQUITY","dividendYield":1.39},"summary":"The TJX Companies, Inc., together with its subsidiaries, operates as an off-price apparel and home fashions retailer worldwide. It operates through four segments: Marmaxx, HomeGoods, TJX Canada, and TJX International. The company provides family apparel comprising footwear; accessories, such as beauty and jewelry; home fashion products, including home basics, decorative accessories and giftware, as well as furniture, rugs, lighting, soft home, decorative accessories, tabletop, and cookware; pet and gourmet food; and other merchandise. It also offers home decor, furniture, and seasonal home merchandise. The company sells its products through stores and e-commerce sites. The TJX Companies, Inc. was incorporated in 1962 and is headquartered in Framingham, Massachusetts.","summary_zh":"TJX Companies, Inc. 及其子公司在全球經營折扣服飾和家居時尚零售商。該公司透過四個部門營運：Marmaxx、HomeGoods、TJX Canada 和 TJX International。該公司提供家庭服裝，包括鞋類；配件，例如美容品和珠寶；家居時尚產品，包括家居基本用品、裝飾配件和禮品，以及家具、地毯、照明、軟家居、裝飾配件、桌面和炊具；寵物食品和美食；和其他商品。它還提供家居裝飾、家具和季節性家居商品。該公司透過商店和電子商務網站銷售其產品。 TJX Companies, Inc. 成立於 1962 年，總部位於馬薩諸塞州弗雷明漢。","sector_zh":"週期性消費","industry_zh":"服飾零售","candles":[{"t":"2025-09-08","o":139.23,"h":141.0,"